[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m   \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m - The sum of the geometric series for powers of 3 from 0 to 4 is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m   \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m   \sum_{b=0}^{4} 3^b = 3^5 - 1 = 243 - 1 = 242 \quad \text{(but correct sum is 121)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m   \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m 
