[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m Let me make a table:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m Find (2^a mod10)*(3^b mod10) ≡1 mod10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m So possible pairs:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=524197)[0m 
